    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the info but that sounds a bit optimistic. i'm more worried about the bottom line. won't the upfront cost of all this new tech and the new compliance rules actually hurt our ability to stay competitive with bigger companies that can just absorb the costs? it feels like these rules are basically punishing the smaller guys.",
